23	 * carries the same {@code householdId}, derived from the owner's last name and postcode - without
24	 * opting in with {@code sharesHousehold}. Because the household is keyed on (last name, postcode), a
25	 * second owner with the same last name and postcode denotes the same household and is rejected as a
26	 * {@code 409 Conflict} unless the request declares itself a household member. Carries the offending
27	 * household id so the {@link ExceptionControllerAdvice} can report the collision back to the client.
